990434439", "personaname": "Eagle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/EmmArend/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 9943, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8776, "last_played": 1585519032, "avatar": "66280300e638106aa86370f67bba90bb8356415c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I recommend the game, but I don't play it anymore since squad is available.\n\nSquad has the same intense gameplay but without the 30 minutes travel and five minutes combat before you get shot over and over... Because the AI accuracy is almost over the top\n\n\nThe final reason I quit playing is because of the dumb-ass ARSENAL system.\nCan't be a medic- light machine gunner anymore or have the slightest zoom on your optical sights without being a sniper.\n\nBut it's immersive and fun to play (with others)...", "timestamp_created": 1521838981, "timestamp_updated": 1521838981, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41001367", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078144389", "personaname": "Dragon King Pz", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DragonKingPz/", "num_games_owned": 184, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 27327, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16869, "last_played": 1748998251, "avatar": "1c9a52c39cf3ab8c03126e56d55f8e0cd46d260c"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a pritty good game. I have an Exile server running on Winter Chernarus with zombies working on the loot and death position but still playable. If anyone wants to join the server name is Das Drakos Dity Exile server", "timestamp_created": 1521838066, "timestamp_updated": 1521838066, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41000661", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986525418", "personaname": "CuppaTea", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ItsCuppaTea/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 21027, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18849, "last_played": 1531796920, "avatar": "af0dd91c738644823e96c9b62cf86f5fbc0c7142"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pros\n- Beautiful map\n- Great Mil-Sim Game\n- Multiple game modes\n- Requires Stradegy and Practice\n\n\nCons\n-Story Mode can get annoying on certain missions\n-Runs like a tank (Isn't optimised on every computer)\n-I didn't find it too fun to play alone but that's just my thought\n\n\nFinal Remarks\nThis game is a blast. Im a huge fan of Zeus (Free DLC offered by ARMA). Great to make friends with and joke around on. Highly suggest if your computer can handle the game. If you are looking for a challenging shooter that isn't the typical COD or Battlefield type of game, Look no further than ARMA.", "timestamp_created": 1521835523, "timestamp_updated": 1521835523, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}